SchallRadarAlignment.description:
"Square (Optimal)": (Default) {0, 2r+1, 4r+2, ..., n(2r+1)}
"Square (Intersecting)": {0, 2r, 4r, ..., n(2r)}
"Square (Double intersecting)": {0, r, 2r, 3r, 4r, ..., nr}
"Quasi-hexagonal (Scanning Radar)": Dedicated for radars in mod “Scanning Radar”, which have circular coverage.
